# git-a-profile

This repo is the git-a-profile pipeline: forge a one-of-a-kind GitHub profile, org,
or project README. To run it, read AGENTS.md and PRINCIPLES.md, then work
loops/00-bootstrap.md → loops/04-verify.md in order, stopping at Gates A, B, and C
for the human. Custom committed SVGs only, one unique signature per subject,
brand color sampled from reality, real data, accessible by default, verified live.
